# {{ .Project }}

Renoir-style Blazor application generated with aspgen.

Layers: DomainModel, Application, Infrastructure, Persistence, Resources, and AppBlazor.

## Build and run

From the generated project root:

```powershell
dotnet restore .\{{ .Project }}.sln
dotnet build .\{{ .Project }}.sln
dotnet run --project .\src\{{ .Project }}.AppBlazor\{{ .Project }}.AppBlazor.csproj
```

Create a bounded context before adding aggregates:

```powershell
aspgen add context Catalog --project .
aspgen add aggregate Product name:string price:decimal active:bool --context Catalog --project .
```
